Active [check box] - ShiftCalendar
To make your facility work in shifts, select this check box. To deactivate shift work, clear the check box.
Remarks
Instead, you can also right-click the ShiftCalendar object in the Frame and select Activate on the context
menu.
To deactivate shift operation, select Deactivate on the context menu.
