Pauses [ShiftCalendar]
Type in the times of the breaks for each shift into these cells.
Remarks
Note
Before you can type data into the table on the tab, click the Inheritance check box so that it is turned off
.
Type in the hour and the minute when the break starts, a hyphen and the hour and minute the break ends.
When you define several breaks, separate them with a semicolon.
To define a coffee break from 9 o’clock to a quarter past 9 o’clock, and a lunch break from 12 o’clock to a
quarter till 1 o’clock, type in 9:00-9:15;12:00-12:45.
To make the ShiftCalendar check if the values you typed in for the breaks are plausible or not and if you
used the correct format to enter the break times, click Apply.
SimTalk
